角度/低角度/倾斜/航拍/俯视）、类型（干净单人/双人/三人/群像/定场）\n色调：暖色调、冷色调、高饱和度、低饱和度\n\n人物姿态与运动与人物情绪\n人物姿态：背身、背面视角、从后方拍摄、全身背身、斜侧 30 度、三分之一侧面、侧身 45 度、半斜侧、正侧面、侧身 90 度、轮廓视角、正面视角、全身正面、正面站立\n运动类型：街舞、跑步、滑滑板、踢足球、网球、乒乓球、滑雪、篮球、顶碗舞、侧手翻\n人物情绪：愤怒、恐惧、高兴、悲伤、惊讶\n\n运镜类型\n基础运镜：镜头推进、镜头拉远、镜头向右移动、镜头向左移动、镜头上摇\n高级运镜：手持镜头、复合运镜、环绕运镜\n\n视觉风格:毛毡风格、3D卡通、像素风格、木偶动画、3D游戏、黏土风格、二次元、水彩画、黑白动画、油画风格\n\n特效镜头:延时拍摄\n\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "Text Multiline", "properties": {"cnr_id": "pr-was-node-suite-comfyui-47064894", "ver": "ea935d1044ae5a26efa54ebeb18fe9020af49a45", "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [11, 12], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [223.26718139648438, 112], "pos": [1303.78125, 437.8497314453125], "widgets_values": ["", "去空行"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "input_string"}, "name": "input_string", "link": 10, "label": "input_string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "input_string"}, {"widget": {"name": "option"}, "name": "option", "label": "option", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "option"}], "flags": {}, "id": 13, "type": "ProcessString", "properties": {"ver": "unknown", "widget_ue_connectable": {"input_string": true, "option": true}, "aux_id": "MeeeyoAI/ComfyUI_StringOps", "Node name for S&R": "ProcessString"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [3], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [751.042236328125, 208.6940155029297], "widgets_values": ["Qwen-Image-Edit-F2P.safetensors", 0.1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 2, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name"}, "name": "lora_name", "label": "lora_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "lora_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_model"},